From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:13:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: remove the dump_render debug rings

The eight dump_render_* parameters logged or buffered submitted render
Works for diffing against hang reports. They served the A4 wedge hunt,
which closed with a userspace root cause, and no boot, kit or tool uses
them. At their defaults they did nothing, so production behaviour is
unchanged. The fw_trace & 256 detach summary stays, as report_vm_detach.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
